# 🚀 Space Mission Design Game

An interactive space mission planning and simulation game where players take the role of a Mission Director and design spacecraft missions to explore space.

## 🌌 About the Project

Space Mission Design Game allows players to plan missions, configure spacecraft, select launch vehicles, manage resources, and simulate mission outcomes.

The goal is to understand the challenges of space exploration through an interactive mission-control experience.

## ✨ Features

- 🪐 Multiple Missions – Earth Observation, Lunar Reconnaissance, Mars Pathfinder and Storm Watch.
- 🚀 Spacecraft Configuration – Customize mission parameters and spacecraft components.
- 🛰️ 3D Space Visualization – Explore spacecraft and planetary environments.
- ⚡ Power Management – Configure power generation for the spacecraft.
- 💰 Budget Management – Plan missions within available resources.
- 📡 Mission Simulation – Simulate mission performance and unexpected events.
- 📊 Mission Reports – View engineering checks, mission performance and final results.
- 🌍 Interactive Mission Control Interface.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- React.js
- JavaScript
- Three.js
- Node.js
- Socket.IO
- HTML5
- CSS3

