## ⚙️ Installation & Setup

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL
```

### 2. Open the project

```bash
cd space-mission-design-game
```

### 3. Install dependencies

Navigate to the client and server folders and install their dependencies:

```bash
cd client
npm install
```

Install server dependencies separately:

```bash
cd ../server
npm install
```

### 4. Run the application

Start the backend using its configured start command, then start the frontend:

```bash
cd client
npm run dev
```

Make sure to configure any required environment variables before starting the backend.

